Subject: [PATCH] Align installed AP event parameters with the runtime snapshot ABI

Apply to unified-wifi-mesh-header after its existing ABI alignment patch.
Include the earlier native AP-query fields as well as the report-owned
backhaul snapshot fields so the installed public definition matches runtime.
Rebuild the header provider, native mesh, OneWifi and libwebconfig together.

Upstream-Status: Pending

